        <div class="proj-desc">Supply-chain attack detection at a molecular level. A differential analyzer that judges whether the change between two versions — of a tree, repo, package, or container image — is malicious. Built to catch subtle attacks like xz-utils. In heavy development; formerly c.diff.</div>
